    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i've thought about therapy but it feels pointless. i feel like if i tell someone \"i have a good life but i feel nothing\" they'll just think i'm being ungrateful or dramatic. it's just this constant, heavy nothingness. i just want it to stop. i just want the silence to be real instead of this weird, static-y gray feeling.",
